OL,3,A'Even babies are coughing': Life at
OL,4,Aepicentre of Indonesian wildfires
OL,5,Achoking Singapore and Malaysia
OL,6,
OL,7,FPressure is mounting on Indonesia to
OL,8,Fstop the fires that are causing the
OL,9,Fhaze, which have been made worse by an
OL,10,Funusually strong El Nino
OL,12,FSingapore has warned companies blamed
OL,13,Ffor the haze, saying its "determination
OL,14,Fto act" should not be underestimated
OL,16,FFresh student protests are expected in
OL,17,FJakarta today as student activists
OL,18,Fdemand that the government declare a
OL,19,Fnational emergency to better respond to
OL,20,Fthe situation
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
